================================================================================
Responsible-use note
================================================================================

This package is released to enable verification and extension of the paper's
results. It deliberately omits:

  - Raw model responses (could distribute harmful content)
  - The specific attacker prompts used in the experiments
  - SS-MT escalation scripts
  - BoK strategy variant text
  - SQL database backups
  - Annotator identities

If you reuse any artifact in a way that involves operational red-teaming or
release of harmful capabilities, please consult the paper's Ethical
Considerations section and follow the same responsible-disclosure protocol
described there.
